<view class="ui-page task-page">
  <text class="ui-kicker">每日积累 / 今日任务</text><view class="ui-title">每一步，<text>都算数。</text></view><text class="ui-lead">选择适合自己的节奏，慢慢攒起喜欢。</text>
  <view class="task-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="green" size="34"/><text>奖励以实际到账为准，普通阅读始终免费。</text></view>
  <view class="ui-section-head"><text>今天可以做</text><view class="task-refresh" bindtap="retry"><yx-icon name="refresh" tone="muted" size="30"/><text>刷新</text></view></view>
  <view class="ui-card task-item task-sign"><view class="task-item-top"><view class="task-symbol"><yx-icon name="check" tone="ink" size="48"/></view><view class="task-description"><text class="task-name">每日签到</text><text class="task-sub">{{signLoading?'正在同步签到进度':(signAvailable?'已连续签到 '+signStreak+' 天':'签到进度暂未同步')}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{signed}}" class="task-status-tag">今日已完成</text></view><view class="task-item-bottom"><text class="task-reward">{{signed?'坚持已经记下':(signReward!==null?'今日 +'+signReward+' 金币':'7天奖励提前看')}}</text><button class="task-button" bindtap="goSign">{{signed?'查看记录':'去签到'}}</button></view></view>
  <yx-state wx:if="{{loading && !loaded}}" type="loading" title="正在获取今日任务"/>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="ui-card task-item"><view class="task-item-top"><view class="task-symbol brand"><yx-icon name="play" tone="brand" size="48"/></view><view class="task-description"><text class="task-name">视频奖励</text><text class="task-sub">自愿完整观看激励视频</text></view><text class="task-status-tag {{home.available?'ready':''}}">{{home.status}}</text></view><view class="task-meta"><text wx:if="{{home.coins!==null}}">每次 +{{home.coins}} 金币</text><text>{{home.remaining!==null?'剩余 '+home.remaining+' 次':'次数待同步'}}</text></view><view class="task-item-bottom"><text class="task-condition">{{home.hint}}</text><button class="task-button" disabled="{{!home.available || watching}}" loading="{{watching}}" bindtap="watchHome">{{watching?'处理中':home.button}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="ui-card task-item"><view class="task-item-top"><view class="task-symbol"><yx-icon name="book" tone="green" size="48"/></view><view class="task-description"><text class="task-name">阅读页视频奖励</text><text class="task-sub">免费阅读，自主选择视频奖励</text></view></view><view class="task-meta"><text wx:if="{{read.coins!==null}}">每次 +{{read.coins}} 金币</text><text>{{read.remaining!==null?'剩余 '+read.remaining+' 次':'次数待同步'}}</text></view><view class="task-item-bottom"><text class="task-condition">{{read.status}} · 阅读不要求观看广告</text><button class="task-button secondary" bindtap="goRead">去阅读</button></view></view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="task-error" bindtap="retry"><yx-icon name="refresh" tone="brand" size="32"/><text>{{error}}</text></view>
  <view class="task-explain"><yx-icon name="coin" tone="muted" size="40"/><view><text>看得清楚，攒得安心</text><text>视频剩余次数分别统计，当日金币预算可能共用。冷却、次数用尽或奖励处理中时，请以最新状态为准。</text></view></view>
  <view class="task-links"><view bindtap="goLedger"><text>核对金币明细</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="ink" size="28"/></view><view bindtap="goInvite"><text>看看我的好友</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="ink" size="28"/></view></view>
</view><include src="/sage_dksy/pages/nav/nav.wxml"/>
